(text "PERFBOARD HEADERS / MODULE MOUNTS" (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0091e3cc-551b-4aca-b963-30ea6dfd671f"))
(text "Pin numbers match the layout and Harness.csv. Contacts use the 2.54 mm grid; J103 pairs span 5.08 mm. Mount pins and cable pins are shown." (at 15.24 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4ebb84cf-dbaf-40c6-b46e-79ef2e66baa4"))
(text "J101: STEP/GND pairs 1/2, 5/6, 9/10.\nJ101.4 = M1_ALM; .8 = 3.3 V; .12 = EN.\nJ102 retains A/B/Z ground pairs. J113: GND 2/8.\nJ103: U1 mount; OUT+/OUT- feed 5 V/GND.\nJ112 is the DM542T 24 V / GND power outlet." (at 139.7 93.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e0fc18bb-d90b-442c-b8e5-00e1907312cb"))
(text "J104: 1 PUL+, 2 PUL-, 3 DIR+, 4 DIR-, 5 ENA+, 6 ENA-.\nJ105/J106: 1 VDD, 2 GND, 3 DIR, 4 STEP, 5 MS1, 6 MS2,\n7 DIAG, 8 INDEX, 9 UART shared bus, 10 EN.\n11 = JP1.6 / +24 V; 12 = JP1.5 / GND.\nJ107 follows the numbered J2 encoder connector." (at 139.7 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9ce57e7c-e922-49e5-973f-929c22562310"))
(text "J101 -> CN10: 1->29, 3->26, 5->32, 7->10, 9->34, 11->8, 12->30.\nJ101.4 -> CN9.17 (ALM); .8 -> CN8.7 (3.3 V); .2/.6/.10 -> GND.\nJ103/J105/J106 are direct module mounts, no cable. Other headers use cables. Matching names are one conductor.\nJ108-J111 (Nucleo reference inputs and the three NC switches): see the Reference limit switches sheet." (at 20.32 254 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0d1710f3-3050-41a9-be7c-5506364734fe"))
(text "Pins 3/4: VIN- / GND and VIN+ / 24 V.\n24 V enters U1 through its barrel jack.\nPins 1/2: regulated OUT+ / OUT-." (at 213.36 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "076666cd-0bfe-41b0-8a1d-31d5232ed38d"))
